#: data/metainfo/org.gtkhash.gtkhash.metainfo.xml.in.in:10
msgid ""
"GtkHash is an application for computing file checksums, or message digests. "
"It's designed to be an easy to use, graphical alternative to command-line "
"programs such as md5sum."
msgstr ""
"GtkHash on rakendus failide kontrollsummade või sõnumite kokkuvõtete "
"arvutamiseks. See on loodud lihtsasti kasutatavaks graafiliseks "
"alternatiiviks käsureaprogrammidele nagu md5sum."

#: data/metainfo/org.gtkhash.gtkhash.metainfo.xml.in.in:15
msgid "Supported hash functions include MD5, SHA1, SHA256, SHA512 and CRC32."
msgstr "Toetatud räsifunktsioonid hõlmavad MD5, SHA1, SHA256, SHA512 ja CRC32."

